#. Description of the plugin
#: entry-digest-for-gravity-forms.php
msgid "Sends scheduled, readable email digests of your Gravity Forms entries - a summary block plus an inline table of submissions - on a daily, weekly, or one-time schedule. Unlimited digests, one form each. Find it under Forms › Entry Digest (or Tools › Entry Digest if Gravity Forms is inactive)."
