msgid "CSV & Excel Attachments"
msgstr ""

#: admin/pro-page.php:37
msgid "Attach the full period’s entries as a CSV or native Excel (.xlsx) file. Recipients get the scannable summary in the email and the complete dataset ready to sort, filter, or import."
